# What b33p's image build copies (`COPY . .`, testbox/b33p/Containerfile): the workspace's sources,
# not the build output (the repository's .containerignore says so for the images that take the
# whole of it; a Containerfile's own ignore file replaces that one, so its entries are here too)
# and not what a build of b33p doesn't read: without this, a change to the xtask, the docs or
# another image's files made the layer new, and every workspace crate compiled again (about
# 45 s with Slint's and GPUI's dependencies built, minutes without).
target
testbox/tools/target
.git

# The workspace's xtask member keeps its manifest (cargo reads every member's); the Containerfile
# puts an empty main.rs in place of its sources.
xtask/src
xtask/tests

# Documents, notes and packaging: nothing in a crate includes them.
docs
pending
packaging
.github
*.md
justfile
deny.toml

# testbox/tools is a path dependency of the xtask; every other image's files are not b33p's.
testbox/*
!testbox/tools
